{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":132311,\"title\":\"Guinevere\",\"tagline\":\"Queen. Lover. Savior.\",\"overview\":\"As border wars break out in Camelot, the young princess Guinevere is taken to live in safety with the High Priestess L'Fei. When King Arthur claims the crown, Guinevere is promised to him and she must leave her true love, Prince Lancelot in order to unite the land. In a tale of honor, loyalty and the price of war, Guinevere is forced to choose between the only man she has ever loved and her duty to her kingdom.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w5dTB9wetCAPa1dWKUifuOw0rTC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ykTzWBvVQ28MFnZ9m4q0lxztwGz.jpg\",\"rating\":3.3,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":1994,\"runtime\":96,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"LT\",\"name\":\"Lithuania\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Jud Taylor\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":117865,\"name\":\"Jud Taylor\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/27HKQcfeY2jZvFF0D5XvVht0nSC.jpg\"},{\"id\":6726,\"name\":\"Sheryl Lee\",\"character\":\"Guinevere\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4w6V09jri2rP6u1JkaEkZC76KLY.jpg\"},{\"id\":54789,\"name\":\"Sean Patrick Flanery\",\"character\":\"King Arthur\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aHQtxIjMEDWdXqvFJplx0Kcwdn6.jpg\"},{\"id\":13526,\"name\":\"Noah Wyle\",\"character\":\"Lancelot\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nwyLCQepwg8FX7OXJ4AT4ej8c7i.jpg\"},{\"id\":42601,\"name\":\"Brid Brennan\",\"character\":\"Morgan L'Fei\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Dgw95jGHm0mwQEBc9KO3BkTGpV.jpg\"},{\"id\":9221,\"name\":\"Donald Pleasence\",\"character\":\"Merlin\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/crtSwLnlrEidYFPupkVBSL9wK9Z.jpg\"},{\"id\":27425,\"name\":\"Constantine Gregory\",\"character\":\"Leodogan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Wu1DUqLi8ZclEcdLGgYgnNcPmw.jpg\"},{\"id\":8550,\"name\":\"Martin East\",\"character\":\"Gawain\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":48968,\"name\":\"Ben Pullen\",\"character\":\"Kei\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1095105,\"name\":\"Andrius Bobrovas\",\"character\":\"Percival\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":457640,\"name\":\"Kęstutis Jakštas\",\"character\":\"Yvain\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9qPxJIUqEV5ZWlA3dgB8WPiaAmK.jpg\"},{\"id\":27397,\"name\":\"Anton Lesser\",\"character\":\"Envoy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x0lmqgkmphvOCSTHk2oxsaxA9Ra.jpg\"},{\"id\":1266585,\"name\":\"James Greene\",\"character\":\"Bishop\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iBwucAzOlYaI7yncN3TTEQQb4vE.jpg\"},{\"id\":5611638,\"name\":\"Regina Share\",\"character\":\"Kaethi\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1236170,\"name\":\"Laura Girling\",\"character\":\"Guinevere's mother\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5611641,\"name\":\"Saulius Sipras\",\"character\":\"Damon\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844234,\"title\":\"A Sentença\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jWkZzzr0ZK5BmHxp2QMvF3ITsQn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dMJ45ukXctpFHOgGAxYt72jG2jn.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4523,\"title\":\"Enchanted\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4UpRDi0w84aNrigr9p049rMHiy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn't operate on a \\\"happily ever after\\\" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460403,\"title\":\"Ein Sommer in Südfrankreich\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/25Doi7gNpG4v0N3rpL47LKVySLp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wOLTGpSdoxfC220a6rhOni6tRoe.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the death of uncle Olivier, his estate, a small chateau in Provence and the small town's only undertaker firm in its cellar, befall equally and jointly to his local stepson André Vidal, who runs the business since Olivier semi-retired ill, and German cousin, business consultant Charlotte. She arrives from Frankfort to sell the estate at the skyrocketing prices for such idyllic hospitality industry sites. André is shocked, determined to preserve the town's social fabric by preserving Olivier's heritage, and disappointed she doesn't even recognize him as childhood best playmate. It turns out the backward taxes are a ticking bomb, which she sneakily intends to ignite, only André's charms and the lavender-scented bucolic way of life appeal ever more even to businesslike Charlotte.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"oZcQUc_S-SY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"E57_Xh5LSXQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"UJ-MOboHd_w\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}